#
# Balance ON (as pan_AO since 2026-10-02, after its -11 Sv free-surface
# drift). Leave OBCS_balanceFac{N,S,E,W} at their default 1: all four
# boundaries share ONE global correction. A value of -1 would balance each
# boundary separately and kill the Lincoln Sea -> Baffin throughflow, which
# is the point of this domain. Balance is a safety net, not a diagnosis:
# check the per-boundary transports offline from the OBCS files.
#
 useOBCSbalance   = .TRUE.,
 OBCSbalanceSurf  = .TRUE.,
# NOT wired, deliberately (as pan_AO): OB{N,S,E,W}etaFile. kerguelen -- the working 4-open-boundary
# precedent -- prescribes t/s/u/v + sea ice and leaves eta unset. Wiring a
# field no sibling region wires, is not something to do
# silently as part of a tracer fix. Left for a deliberate decision.
#
# NOT wired, for a different reason: OB{N,S,E,W}slFile (sea ice HSALT).
# The shared parent dv extraction does not output sea-ice HSALT either.
#
# ---------------- North boundary ----------------
 OBNtFile    = 'THETA_north.bin',
 OBNsFile    = 'SALT_north.bin',
 OBNuFile    = 'UVEL_north.bin',
 OBNvFile    = 'VVEL_north.bin',
